OL,3,GNEWSAHow The Beatles found their
OL,4,Adrummer at Butlin's
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire holiday camp played a
OL,7,Flittle-known but crucial part in the
OL,8,Fbirth of The Beatles.
OL,10,FA young, bearded Ringo Starr was
OL,11,Fplaying drums with Rory Storm and the
OL,12,FHurricanes at the Butlins in Skegness
OL,13,Fin the summer 1962 when Paul McCartney
OL,14,Fand John Lennon arrived to try and
OL,15,Frecruit him to the band.
OL,17,FBobby Thomson, who was bassist in the
OL,18,FHurricanes, recalls the duo arriving
OL,19,Fearly one morning after driving all
OL,20,Fnight from Liverpool.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
